  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Maritime Operations and Safety, through I.M. Systems Group, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This reverse trade mission (RTM) familiarized delegates from China&apos;s Ministry of Transportation, Maritime Safety Administration, and other regional transportation bureaus with U.S. practices and technologies in the areas of maritime transportation operations, safety, and environmental protection. The RTM aimed to help China&apos;s government to increase the safety and efficiency of ports, inland waterways, and maritime transportation networks and better respond to environmental incidents and maritime emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
